Package: NCRNWater
Type: Package
Title: Data analysis and visualization for NPS I&M water monitoring
Version: 1.1.0
Date: 2026-10-23
Author: John Paul Schmit, Aaron Weed, Kate Miler, Charles Wainright
Maintainer: Charles Wainright <charles_wainright@nps.gov>
Encoding: UTF-8
Description: Tools to analyze and visualize water quality monitoring data in
    water quality portal (WQP) format. Originally developed for National Park Service
    Inventory and Monitoring Program's National Capital Region Network, but 
    can work for others with WQP-formatted data. 
    The package's provided shiny app should work for a WQP-formatted dataset, if the required metadata are provided.
    `NCRNWater::example_data(assign=T)` to explore example data and metadata.
License: Public Domain
